# J2m: G1 at TP4 with the fused prefill out-projection ON (run only after J2 passed with it off)
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): reset 3-12 min; smoke 30-60 min (the engine build is cached from J2): about 45-80 min (step 210).
# The general-tp4 profiles keep QWEN_GDN_PREFILL_MMRS=0. This arm turns the fused matmul + reduce-scatter on at four devices for the first time (it deadlocked on the pair): a hang here is the op's, costs this job, and needs the reset the next job starts with.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-1
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4-mmrs
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,agreement
